# Only runtime code/resources and translation/dependency build inputs enter context.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!requirements-oss.txt
!requirements-r2.txt
!requirements-google-ocr.txt
!requirements-storage-all.txt
!Makefile
!babel.cfg
!manage.py
!app/
!app/**
!files/
!files/fonts/
!files/fonts/**

# Generated/local files are excluded even under allowed directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.mo
**/*.pot
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.env*
